@mars/knowledge-graph

This package wraps the external `graphify` command-line tool
(https://github.com/Graphify-Labs/graphify), pinned to release v0.9.101,
commit ab26b1ec1da995743ef5a165a07b0d45ad3314c8, as a sandboxed subprocess.
No graphify source code is copied, vendored or ported into this repository;
only its JSON output is read.

